    {
      "text": "WARNING: Unlike the ordinary tester, the insulation resistance tester applies 500 V when measuring. If used incorrectly, there is the danger of electric shock. If used in the vehicle 12V system, there is the danger of damage to electronic devices. Read  the  insulation  resistance  tester  instruction  manual carefully and be sure to work safely.",
