      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "LI-ION BATTERY INSULATION RESISTANCE LOSS CHECK",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        117.66,
        769.00991,
        493.80474239999967,
        757.1101191491713
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the inspection result normal?",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        524.7559299999999,
        196.92755759999997,
        515.5123424640884
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "YES >> .Replace high voltage harness.",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        57.84,
        510.29594000000003,
        252.35567879999977,
        501.0523524640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "HIGH_VOLTAGE"
    },
    {
      "text": "NO >> GO TO 17.",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        57.84,
        498.77540000000005,
        159.88682400000005,
        489.53181246408843
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "17.CHECK MODULE-5",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        487.70399999999995,
        170.76086399999994,
        471.7667801104972
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove rear module stack. Refer to EVB-261, \"REAR MODULE STACK : Disassembly and Assembly\". NOTE:",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.139391599999996,
        464.45598839999997,
        551.42228,
        443.6929308640884
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not disassemble module stack.",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        71.9996276,
        441.4171268,
        231.20127560000014,
        432.1735392640884
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure voltages between terminal / of all modules in rear module stack and module body.",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.1396156,
        428.99665880000003,
        368.23556719999965,
        408.2336796640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the inspection result normal?",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.1396156,
        184.55773520000002,
        196.92717319999997,
        175.3141476640884
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "YES >> GO TO 18.",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        57.84,
        170.09601999999995,
        159.89778599999994,
        160.85243246408845
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "NO >> Replace malfunctioning module. Refer to EVB-261, \"REAR MODULE STACK : Disassembly and Assembly\".",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        57.84,
        158.5766284,
        558.5216244,
        137.8124224640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "18.CHECK MODULE-6",
      "page_pdf": 184,
      "page_manual": "EVB-184",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        135.9841,
        170.76086399999994,
        120.04688011049723
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "LI-ION BATTERY INSULATION RESISTANCE LOSS CHECK",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        117.96001,
        769.00991,
        494.13539559999975,
        757.1101191491713
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure insulation resistance between terminal / of all modules in rear module stack and module body.",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        734.87592,
        369.62580519999966,
        714.1723444640885
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING: Unlike  the  ordinary  tester,  the  insulation  resistance  tester applies 500 V when measuring. If used incorrectly, there is the danger  of  electric  shock.  If  used  in  the  vehicle  12V  system, there is the danger of damage to electronic devices. Read the insulation resistance tester instruction manual carefully and be sure to work safely.",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001,
        708.8960844,
        107.58932199999994,
        699.6524968640884
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "WARNING"
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION: Be sure to set the insulation resistance tester to 500 V when performing  this  test.  Using  a  setting  higher  than  500  V  can result in damage to the component being inspected.",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.46001000000001,
        628.3757052000002,
        104.63689000000002,
        619.1321176640887
      ],
      "type": "warning",
      "safety_level": "CAUTION"
    },
    {
      "text": "Is the inspection result normal?",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        53.460010000000025,
        482.4571824000004,
        198.3867328000001,
        473.2135948640888
      ],
      "type": "section_header",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "YES-1 >> Replace or repair of malfunctioning part is not-yet performed: Replace Li-ion battery controller. Refer to EVB-214, \"LI-ION BATTERY CONTROLLER : Removal and Installation\".",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        59.10001,
        467.93592,
        559.7835135999999,
        447.2323124640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "YES-2 >> Replace or repair of malfunctioning part is complete: INSPECTION END.",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        59.10040600000002,
        444.95536000000004,
        446.53298199999955,
        435.7117724640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "NO >> Replace malfunctioning module. Refer to EVB-261, \"REAR MODULE STACK : Disassembly and Assembly\".",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        59.10040600000002,
        433.43482000000006,
        559.8446703999999,
        412.7323124640884
      ],
      "type": "procedure_step",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    },
    {
      "text": "EVB",
      "page_pdf": 185,
      "page_manual": "EVB-185",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        568.37988,
        643.6912671800001,
        588.3435248437999,
        634.8726633204641
      ],
      "type": "general_text",
      "safety_level": "NONE"
    }
